    summary: 'A contest is a request with the prize put up from the start: for example the best logo, three winners, 300 USDC, entries open for a week. The buyer runs one from Start a trade on the market, at /contests/new, or by asking the assistant (propose_contest); the card shows the prize, the Karwan fee (half of 1 percent of the prize), the total and what each place gets, and the buying agent puts up the prize when they confirm. One to three winners; the prize splits 100, 70 and 30, or 50, 30 and 20. Entries stay open 1 to 30 days and the buyer then has 7 days to pick. Anyone except the buyer enters from the contest page with up to four images or PDF files of 5 MB and a note, or by sending the files to the assistant with a caption such as "my entry" and asking it to enter (propose_contest_entry); entering again replaces their entry. The buyer sees each entry as its first image and the note, never the full files, until they pay the winners. Picking before entries close needs every place; after, the buyer can fill fewer places and the rest comes back. Each winner is paid their share less half the fee on it, and their full files go to the buyer. A contest nobody has entered can be taken back with the prize and fee returned. If nobody is picked by the date, Karwan returns the prize to the buyer, and with entries the buyer\'s record shows the contest was not awarded. In Telegram, running a contest and paying the winners open Karwan to confirm; entering stays in the chat. Contests are on Arc Testnet, up to about 1,000 USDC each for now.',
    steps: ['On the market, under Can\'t find it?, open More ways to start and choose Run a contest, or ask the assistant.', 'Say what you want, the prize, how many winners and how long entries stay open, then put up the prize.', 'Sellers enter with their work; you see each preview and note.', 'Pick the winners in place order and pay them; their files come to you.'],
    sources: ['frontend/features/contests/components/ContestPage.tsx', 'backend/src/contests/contests.ts', 'docs/architecture/40-contests-and-agent-jobs.md'],
